Here we have created a Weather forecast app , implementing OpenWeather API to recieve accurate information regarding the weather for the current as well as upcoming 4 days.

Features of the Weather Forecast :
1) Users are able to select any location , via the city name and the system shall display the weather information for that city.
2) Weather onformation of a location include the Current temperature , what ot feels like , humidity , description , the minimum temperature and the maximum temperature and finally an icon.
3) We have also implemented personal warnings if temperature is not suited for the outdoors.
4) All the users history is stores as well using localstorage allowing revisiting old searches.
5) Users can also search the information based on their Current Location of user.
6) The temperature can be displayed in various Units like Kelvin , Celcius and Fahrenheit Usong a dropdown.
7) If the temperature is rainy the backgorund of the website will turn to a rainy image to dynamically describe the weather.

The link to my github project : https://github.com/SupratikDey/Weather-Forecast-Application-Development-in-JavaScript
